{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有冇諗過可以一路觀光東京，一路食壽司？日本「Sushi Bus Co.」與「Willer Across」聯手，宣布將於今年 10 月推出全球首架「迴轉壽司巴士」。乘客可以坐喺雙層開篷巴士嘅二樓露天座位，一邊觀光銀座、澀谷十字路口、淺草雷門等，一邊享受 70 分鐘無限量放題壽司！巴士一樓設有專用廚房即場握壽司，再透過升降設備送上二樓嘅真實迴轉輸送帶，真係好似係壽司店咁！</p><p>全車僅設 20 個尊貴席位，每日限跑 5 班，即每日僅接待約 100 位幸運兒，絕對係超難搶嘅「極致稀有體驗」！官方更表示，若東京路線反應熱烈，未來不排除將呢個超爆話題嘅「SUSHI BUS」擴展至大阪同京都，大家有冇興趣試下呢？</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178758870527253948_895154206a8c7061ef765.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178758870764190994_17642218866a8c7064741a2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178758871009034106_4425404716a8c7066d871b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178758871235043737_8228306596a8c7069512ba.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178758871527614326_7569245686a8c706bbdcbb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17875887171862896_723313746a8c706e198d7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T16:38:51.508763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}